<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS0-Indonesia deal sparks Orbital shares.</title>
<headline>RTRS0-Indonesia deal sparks Orbital shares.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Australian engine designer Orbital Engine Corp Ltd rose nearly 10 percent on Friday after the company said its combustion process engine had been selected to power the planned Indonesia national car.</p>
<p>At 10.20 a.m. (0020 GMT), Orbital shares were 10 cents or 9.8 percent higher at A$1.12.</p>
</text>
